{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_23", "source_id": "665410030000000005004554", "title": "300元搞定油敏肌护肤", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_665410030000000005004554", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1052, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 100, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天分享一个300块钱左右就能搞进", "快速正进舒缓正在明明的皮肤 如果脸上有这种发烫的情况 还可以用一个这种冰敷影音", "大概过个两三分钟之后 皮肤就会变成一个眼的光状态 我这个油皮真的是爱死", "我就感觉像照了一层无形的水 涂在脸上一样 一直远远不断的给我的皮肤", "晚上用它 后腹舒缓震静 直接连一个 涂抹面霜的钱都省 真的性价比非常非常高", "会再给它裂涂一次 它真的太太太腥薄了 所以哪怕我跌涂之后", "这里注意一定要用按压的手法 千万不要这样出来错区 这样才不会让那种红红明明的问题加重"], "retained_quotes": ["会再给它裂涂一次 它真的太太太腥薄了 所以哪怕我跌涂之后", "这里注意一定要用按压的手法 千万不要这样出来错区 这样才不会让那种红红明明的问题加重"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_665410030000000005004554/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_665410030000000005004554/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_665410030000000005004554/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_665410030000000005004554/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "c4dca82e8c356c992da161d4685d5de0fcbbb55945ce56cae702f5ea84aadb19", "card_hash": "35d7f7a80880f9fac99c912948f3854b23cb56ef552c94352a467f3e41e746ca", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
