{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_23", "source_id": "664829ea0000000014018add", "title": "养好发质的方法（水光发教程）", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_664829ea0000000014018add", "topic_family": "头发护理", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "正常经验内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1201, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 78, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello今天要分享我是怎么养出这种水光发的 你们可能不知道我以前的头发不仅就是发量没有现在这么多", "而且头发会掉得更快 不知道大家有没有了解过头皮护理油 就我现在都是会定期的用这种头皮护理油", "但是其实非常非常重要 对于沙发来说头发毛躁特别容易打结 所以在洗头之前把头发梳开", "这个发膜可以把头发变成这种水光发 然后在阳光下看头发是这种窝光明明的感觉", "然后头发干的时候也可以平时多抹一抹这种发油 真的会让头发看起来更加的有光泽", "最后还有一点就是洗完头之后 一定要及时的把头发给吹干 因为是喜欢头偶尔用吸水精把头发包起来", "但是这种清洁类的头皮护理油 我大概一个月只会有两三次 第二点就是我在每次洗头之前"], "retained_quotes": ["最后还有一点就是洗完头之后 一定要及时的把头发给吹干 因为是喜欢头偶尔用吸水精把头发包起来", "但是这种清洁类的头皮护理油 我大概一个月只会有两三次 第二点就是我在每次洗头之前"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_664829ea0000000014018add/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_664829ea0000000014018add/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_664829ea0000000014018add/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_664829ea0000000014018add/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "4c920d9ca9077cf5851edc9a62f2443fae5d5d8cb69c1143824f7de4ed0f46be", "card_hash": "33e0e89cf40638f23fad3d38db9ade3edbbefd9e8376bf54dae0b17b332cc243", "callable":