{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_23", "source_id": "6646cb420000000014019b72", "title": "靠护肤品把毛孔缩小了", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6646cb420000000014019b72", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1195, "evidence_unit_count": 36, "original_evidence_unit_count": 36, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 97, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小三菱 今天分享我是怎麼靠護膚品縮小毛孔的", "它是真的能讓我的皮膚變得很細膩的 一款護膚品 因為它裡面的成分能夠把我們油皮毛孔粗大的", "等它完全被吸收之後 皮膚摸起來超級清爽 然後縮毛孔 還有一個非常厲害的成分", "而且能夠加快我們皮膚的代謝 從肌力 促進膠原蛋白的生成 搭配上2%的植物A唇和腎態", "好啦今天的分享就到這裡咯", "我第一次又早上起來 就明顯感覺到皮膚出油量少了很多 不像平時那種豬肝裂的狀態", "所以你用起來會感覺效果特別好 我感覺它就像是一把運動 把我臉上的小細紋給運平了"], "retained_quotes": ["我第一次又早上起來 就明顯感覺到皮膚出油量少了很多 不像平時那種豬肝裂的狀態", "所以你用起來會感覺效果特別好 我感覺它就像是一把運動 把我臉上的小細紋給運平了"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6646cb420000000014019b72/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6646cb420000000014019b72/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6646cb420000000014019b72/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6646cb420000000014019b72/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "30d3d3418e7a7071eae525c94f16793e0a2fa96b01fcb146363babdc7a14f74c", "card_hash": "3ad7dc6f36266905b7513336b50fd0b1f0436d1dc212aad982b21f7bad6ec4f1", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_23", "source_id": "6645ce7b000000001e03609d", "title": "减法护肤后，油痘肌终于变得干净又平滑了", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6645ce7b000000001e03609d", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 686, "evidence_unit_count": 20, "original_evidence_unit_count": 20, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 64, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 今天来跟大家分享很适合油皮 油豆皮在夏天使用的面膜", "非常符合我们油皮的护肤需求 不管你长不长的痘 只要你是油皮你就会爱它", "还有水洋酸盐生物 可以帮我们疏通毛孔 毛孔不堵塞了 脸上的痘痘闭口自然就会改善很多", "但我敷它的时候 哪怕我在房间里走动做其他的事情 它都不会往下冰", "可以搭配他们家这个 去洞凝露一起用 具体的他们俩的使用方法 可以看我这条笔记", "我强烈建议所有油皮姐妹 在夏天都要在护肤上做减反 不要各种功效的肤柄都往脸上摸", "皮肤都是一个 Q弹软嫩的状态 上妆也具复体验 那如果想要去洞效果更好的话"], "retained_quotes": ["我强烈建议所有油皮姐妹 在夏天都要在护肤上做减反 不要各种功效的肤柄都往脸上摸", "皮肤都是一个 Q弹软嫩的状态 上妆也具复体验 那如果想要去洞效果更好的话"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6645ce7b000000001e03609d/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6645ce7b000000001e03609d/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6645ce7b000000001e03609d/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6645ce7b000000001e03609d/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "bb7b2e41d41af1c42667d6269711653b0f41619775ec369c1452b8dbdbdc3836", "card_hash": "f91327b0b18d28feae6d3084f1b726c66b63aba89d3015178d2bc3244e7f8b27", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_23", "source_id": "663c90dd000000001e037dd7", "title": "一些让油皮素颜很美丽的护肤搭配", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663c90dd000000001e037dd7", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 2182, "evidence_unit_count": 64, "original_evidence_unit_count": 64, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["肤质：油痘敏肌 护肤需求：长痘的时候能快速灭了，不留痘印", "痘痘今年我偶尔还会长一两颗，但无一例外都消得很快且不留痘印", "Bakuchiol 1FI.Oz.29ml", "Qmdceuticals Dr Dennis Gross", "BarrierBooster The Oasis", "所以我不会一套护肤品死磕非得要用完再换，会根据这段时间的皮肤状况去选择不同的护肤搭配，我的要求就是让皮肤一直保持在比较好的状况，缺哪就补哪", "1、缩毛孔：宝拉烟酰胺+a醇 几乎所有姐妹都想毛孔小一点、再小一点，这一对是我目前用到的在缩毛孔非常有效的搭配，本来烟酰胺和a醇就是绝配，这个是20%烟酰胺，本身就可以k老、缩毛孔、提亮肤色了，和a醇……"], "retained_quotes": ["所以我不会一套护肤品死磕非得要用完再换，会根据这段时间的皮肤状况去选择不同的护肤搭配，我的要求就是让皮肤一直保持在比较好的状况，缺哪就补哪", "1、缩毛孔：宝拉烟酰胺+a醇 几乎所有姐妹都想毛孔小一点、再小一点，这一对是我目前用到的在缩毛孔非常有效的搭配，本来烟酰胺和a醇就是绝配，这个是20%烟酰胺，本身就可以k老、缩毛孔、提亮肤色了，和a醇……"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663c90dd000000001e037dd7/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663c90dd000000001e037dd7/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663c90dd000000001e037dd7/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663c90dd000000001e037dd7/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "80cbb5e60c400610217e263f25afa3787c7a419808b3200559947239d95e39d1", "card_hash": "d1ad3e5fc37037c1af04c7de1b84d786c367e254582824d9b021289122d0aa91", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_23", "source_id": "663b3853000000001e03b869", "title": "精简护肤我爱了！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663b3853000000001e03b869", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 913, "evidence_unit_count": 26, "original_evidence_unit_count": 26, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 71, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 先给大家看两张照片 以前一入下我脸上的豆就跟雨后春损一样冒出来", "他跟我说用了它脸会发光 那我用下来发现效果是真的好 我从去年一直回购到今年", "而且它是真的能让皮肤发光 就像是一块被擦的没有一丝灰尘的锅里", "所以现在只要不化妆我基本上都是用它 敷感也是一点的不油腻", "很干净很均匀 那好了 今天的分享就到这里 油皮的减肥 你们赶快试一试", "后来发现因为我总是想要把护肤品用完再换 但其实入下之后就要换成更精简更清爽的护肤品", "用完它就像开了美颜一样 脸一下就亮起来了 特别修饰黄泣 而且它可以稍微的隐形一下我们的毛口"], "retained_quotes": ["后来发现因为我总是想要把护肤品用完再换 但其实入下之后就要换成更精简更清爽的护肤品", "用完它就像开了美颜一样 脸一下就亮起来了 特别修饰黄泣 而且它可以稍微的隐形一下我们的毛口"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663b3853000000001e03b869/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663b3853000000001e03b869/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663b3853000000001e03b869/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_663b3853000000001e03b869/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "496cd4fc8b4804b38e861e451d05665df42ac1e3674e97d2520a020080a43e0d", "card_hash": "bace055f7bf9bea2bf35a3b81300f5cf1b199b620ecd0292a6822b78f76c91bd", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learn